  <text key="s147">Data port</text>
  <text key="s148">Port: same Beast port in panel and VRS, default 30005.

Gain: auto or 0–21. Excess gain can distort signals.

Sampling: 12/20/24 MHz, not the 1090 MHz frequency. 24 MHz requires a compatible R2. No standalone MLAT.

Filter: default 4, range 1–60. Higher values use more CPU.

USB packing (-p) changes data transport, not antenna power. Leave off if unsure.</text>
